window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>All it took was one bite.</b></p> <p>A week ago, I was the perpetual screw up of the Bannister coven and a probationary agent for the Arcane Bureau of Investigation. Somehow, I’ve managed to get myself mated to an Acosta Alpha, pissed off my family, and gotten on the radar of a dark Fae.</p> <p>As much as I’d like to bury my head in the sand, I have a badge to secure—and with a new case on my proverbial desk—a job to do. Because I’m not the first witch that the Fae has tried to steal, but I will definitely be the last.</p> <p><i>Just as soon as I get this curse under control…</i></p> <p><b>Magic &amp; Mayhem is the second book in The Wrong Witch series. If you enjoy fated mates, enemies-to-lovers, and steamy paranormal romance, then this is the series for you.</b></p>"; 
